---
layout: none
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  The search index, one record per pattern plus one per real page, built by
  Liquid at build time — no plugin, no Node step. assets/js/search.js fetches
  it on first focus of the search field and builds the lunr index in the
  browser (44 patterns index in a few milliseconds).

  Replaces the theme's lunr-store.js, which shipped the whole corpus as a
  script on EVERY page and built the index on every page load, searched or not.

  FIELDS
    type     "positiv", "negativ", "neutral" (the collection) or "page". The
             masthead panel groups and colours rows on it, in the order of
             GROUPS in assets/js/search.js. A type missing there renders nowhere.
    summary  The pattern's one-paragraph summary: the /search/ page shows it as
             the hit's text, and it is weighted between title and body.
    content  The body, minus the "Dies ist ein (unvollständiger) Auszug …" note
             that opens every pattern — indexed, it made every excerpt the same.

  `search: false` keeps a document out entirely. `search_body: false` indexes
  the title only — for the three category pages, whose bodies list every
  pattern's summary: indexed, every query would also return the list page.
{%- endcomment -%}
[
{%- assign sep = '' -%}
{%- assign types = "positiv,negativ,neutral" | split: "," -%}
{%- for type in types -%}
  {%- assign docs = site[type] | where_exp: 'doc', 'doc.search != false' -%}
  {%- for doc in docs -%}
    {%- assign text = doc.content | replace: "</p>", " </p>" | replace: "</h2>", " </h2>"
          | replace: "</h3>", " </h3>" | replace: "</li>", " </li>" | strip_html
          | replace: "Dies ist ein (unvollständiger) Auszug aus dem", ""
          | replace: "gedruckten Buch.", "" -%}
{{ sep }}{
  "url": {{ doc.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
  "type": {{ type | jsonify }},
  "title": {{ doc.title | jsonify }},
  "summary": {{ doc.summary | default: "" | markdownify | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | strip | jsonify }},
  "content": {{ text | normalize_whitespace | strip | jsonify }}
}
    {%- assign sep = ',' -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- for page in site.pages -%}
  {%- if page.title and page.search != false and page.url != '/404.html' -%}
{{ sep }}{
  "url": {{ page.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
  "type": "page",
  "title": {{ page.title | jsonify }},
  "summary": "",
  "content": {% if page.search_body == false %}""{% else %}{{ page.content | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | strip | jsonify }}{% endif %}
}
    {%- assign sep = ',' -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
]
